146:With `hideSectionDividers=true`, indicators appear at the menu scroll edges only while content is hidden beyond that edge: bottom at the start, both in the middle, top at the end, neither without overflow. They do not restore spacing. With `false`, the existing footer separator remains visible whenever the menu overflows, including at the end. The Quick Access separator stays inside the scrolling content and can coexist with these indicators. Setting `--gn-aside-header-divider-horizontal-color: transparent` also hides the scroll indicators.
